Third-party speech models
-------------------------

- Whisper large-v3-turbo Arabic dialectal v2, fine-tuned by oddadmix
  (https://huggingface.co/oddadmix/whisper-large-v3-turbo-arabic-dialectal-v2),
  Apache-2.0. CTranslate2 conversion packaged by parseh
  (https://huggingface.co/parseh/whisper-ar-dialectal-ct2), Apache-2.0.
  Used by the worker for Arabic transcription.
- OpenAI Whisper, MIT. WhisperX and faster-whisper, BSD/Apache-2.0.
- DeepFilterNet3 (Apache-2.0), Demucs (MIT), Resemble Enhance (MIT),
